---@field dataset? string Determines which dataset to use for fetching completion. "user-data" will use the dataset imported through CompletionService.ImportCompletionData. `cloud-retail` will use the dataset generated by Cloud Retail based on user events. If left empty, completions will be fetched from the `user-data` dataset. Current supported values: * user-data * cloud-retail: This option requires enabling auto-learning function first. See [guidelines](https://cloud.google.com/retail/docs/completion-overview#generated-completion-dataset).

