---@field filter? string Deprecated: This field is deprecated. Any filter provided will be ignored.
---@field parent string Required. Resource name of a Branch, and `default_branch` for branch_id component is supported. For example `projects/1234/locations/global/catalogs/default_catalog/branches/default_branch`

