---@field outputUriPrefix? string Required. The output uri prefix for saving output data to json files. Some mapping examples are as follows: output_uri_prefix sample output(assuming the object is foo.json) ======================== ============================================= gs://bucket/ gs://bucket/foo.json gs://bucket/folder/ gs://bucket/folder/foo.json gs://bucket/folder/item_ gs://bucket/folder/item_foo.json

